<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPAIN BEAT MALTA 3-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPAIN BEAT MALTA 3-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TA'QALI 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain beat Malta 3-0 (halftime</p>
<p>2-0) in a European under-21 group six soccer qualifier on</p>
<p>Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Vialcho (10,15, Hernandez 73)</p>
<p>Attendance: 200</p>
</text>
